{
  "id": "Lyo.Compression.Lzma",
  "name": "Lyo.Compression.Lzma",
  "area": "Data",
  "tagline": "LZMA compression addon for `Lyo.Compression`. Registers an LZMA `ICompressorFactory`.",
  "description": "LZMA compression addon for `Lyo.Compression`. Registers an LZMA `ICompressorFactory`.",
  "features": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Register with DI",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "using Lyo.Compression;\nusing Lyo.Compression.Lzma;\nusing Lyo.Compression.Models;\nusing Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration;\nusing Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n\nservices.AddLzmaCompressor();\nservices.AddCompressionService(options => options.DefaultAlgorithm = LzmaCompressionAlgorithm.Instance);\nservices.AddDefaultCompressionService<CompressionService>();\n\n// Or bind options from IConfiguration\nservices.AddLzmaCompressor();\nservices.AddCompressionServiceFromConfiguration(configuration, CompressionServiceOptions.SectionName);\nservices.AddDefaultCompressionService<CompressionService>();"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Dependency injection",
      "text": "See [`Lyo.Compression`](../Lyo.Compression/README.md) for keyed registration, `ICompressionResolver`, and appsettings examples. **File storage reads:** register `AddLzmaCompressor()` when stored metadata may reference LZMA; [ `ICompressionResolver`](../Lyo.Compression/README.md#icompressionresolver-per-algorithm-dispatch) handles read-time decompress."
    }
  ],
